---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: "ind-page"
permalink: "/webinars/index.html"
title: "Free AI Webinars for Australian Businesses | Ad On Group"
description: "Free monthly AI webinars for Australian businesses — accounting, healthcare, NDIS, real estate, construction and legal. Online, 45 minutes, open to anyone. Run by Claude Certified Associates."
---
<main class="ind">

  <section>
    <p class="ind-eyebrow">Free monthly webinars</p>
    <h1>Free AI webinars for Australian businesses</h1>
    <p class="ind-lede">
      One session a month, each on a single real problem in a single industry. Free, online,
      45 minutes, open to anyone &mdash; you don't have to be a client and there's nothing to buy
      at the end of it.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-actions">
      {% if webinarSchedule.upcoming.length %}
      <a class="ind-cta" href="{{ webinarSchedule.upcoming[0].url }}">Next: {{ webinarSchedule.upcoming[0].pretty }}</a>
      {% else %}
      <a class="ind-cta" href="/ai-enquiry/">Get told about the next one</a>
      {% endif %}
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="/programs/">See the training program</a>
    </div>
    <p class="ind-trust">
      Run by Claude Certified Associates at Ad On Group &mdash; Australian-owned since 2008,
      rated 4.8 from 229 Google reviews, and 40+ Australian businesses trained.
    </p>
  </section>

  {% if webinarSchedule.upcoming.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>What's coming up</h2>
    <div class="ind-grid">
      {% for s in webinarSchedule.upcoming %}
      <article class="ind-card">
        <span class="wb-date">{{ s.pretty }} &middot; {{ s.prettyTime }}</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if webinarSchedule.past.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>Already run</h2>
    <p>These have been and gone. The pages stay up, but the recordings live in the academy.</p>
    <div class="ind-more">
      {% for s in webinarSchedule.past %}<a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <div class="ind-note">
      <h2>Why these are free, and where the catch isn't</h2>
      <p>
        We run a paid three-month training program, and these sessions are how people find out
        whether we're any good before spending money with us. That's the whole model. Nobody
        will chase you afterwards for turning up.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Recordings go to academy members rather than to the public.</strong> That's not
        a growth tactic &mdash; it's what our members pay for, and giving it away would be
        unfair to them. Come to the live one if the topic matters to you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Or go straight to your industry</h2>
    <p>Each session pairs with a program built for that sector's actual work.</p>
    <div class="ind-more">
      {% for i in industries.items %}<a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
